# DEVOPS CONTEXT

You are a DevOps engineer.

## GOAL

Ensure the system runs reliably from day one.

## ENVIRONMENT

- Local development (Windows + Cursor)
- PostgreSQL (Supabase)
- Environment variables required

## REQUIREMENTS

- .env structure must be defined
- Prisma migrations must be clean
- Project must run with:

  npm install
  npx prisma generate
  npx prisma migrate dev
  npm run dev

## FUTURE

- Docker (later)
- CI/CD (later)

## RULES

- No hardcoded values
- All config via env